---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact Us" description="Get in touch with the Data Converter team. Report bugs, suggest features, or ask questions." keywords="contact, support, bug report, data converter" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',url:'/'},{name:'Contact',url:'/contact'}]} schema={{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'ContactPage',
  name: 'Contact Us',
  description: 'Get in touch with the Data Converter team.',
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Person',
    name: 'Naim Biswas',
    email: 'nayeembiswas2@gmail.com',
    contactType: 'technical support',
  },
}}>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Contact</h1>

    <p>Have a question, found a bug, or want to suggest a feature? The best place is <strong>GitHub Issues</strong> — that way everyone can see the discussion and solutions.</p>

    <p><a href="https://github.com/NaimBiswas/convert/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-btn">Open a GitHub Issue →</a></p>

    <p>You can also email me directly at <a href="mailto:nayeembiswas2@gmail.com">nayeembiswas2@gmail.com</a>. I try to respond within a day or two.</p>

    <p>If reporting a bug, please include your source format, target format, and any error messages you saw. A sample of the data (or the error) helps me track it down much faster.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .legal p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .legal a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .contact-btn {
    display: inline-block; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--primary); color: #fff !important;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: background var(--transition);
  }
  .contact-btn:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal { margin: 24px auto; }
    .legal h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
